{
 "total": 31.56,
 "planned": false,
 "beats": [
  {
   "text": "This fish finds a partner and never lets go.",
   "visual": "hook",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.181
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a deep-sea anglerfish.",
   "visual": "female",
   "start": 2.181,
   "end": 3.819
  },
  {
   "text": "This is the female, with a glowing lure.",
   "visual": "female",
   "start": 3.819,
   "end": 6.011
  },
  {
   "text": "In the dark, they rarely meet.",
   "visual": "dark",
   "start": 6.011,
   "end": 7.498
  },
  {
   "text": "The male is tiny.",
   "visual": "size",
   "start": 7.498,
   "end": 8.745
  },
  {
   "text": "She can be sixty times longer.",
   "visual": "size",
   "start": 8.745,
   "end": 10.32
  },
  {
   "text": "He has huge nostrils to follow her scent.",
   "visual": "scent",
   "start": 10.32,
   "end": 12.679
  },
  {
   "text": "When he finds her, he bites on.",
   "visual": "bite",
   "start": 12.679,
   "end": 14.357
  },
  {
   "text": "And he never lets go.",
   "visual": "bite",
   "start": 14.357,
   "end": 15.621
  },
  {
   "text": "Their bodies fuse, and they share the same blood.",
   "visual": "fuse",
   "start": 15.621,
   "end": 18.297
  },
  {
   "text": "He gets all his food from her.",
   "visual": "fuse",
   "start": 18.297,
   "end": 19.861
  },
  {
   "text": "Normally, a body attacks tissue that isn't its own.",
   "visual": "immune",
   "start": 19.861,
   "end": 22.877
  },
  {
   "text": "But these anglerfish lost parts of their immune system.",
   "visual": "lost",
   "start": 22.877,
   "end": 26.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Scientists think that's what lets them fuse.",
   "visual": "together",
   "start": 26.08,
   "end": 28.549
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow BioNiche for more weird animals.",
   "visual": "cta",
   "start": 28.549,
   "end": 31.56
  }
 ],
